            "review_title": "Review at Home Bistro",
            "review_text": "Jojo\n4 contributions\n1\nNew restaurant in town\nMar 2021 • Friends\nThey just opend but very soon it is my absolute favorite restaurant in Saigon. Food is fantastic, as always and no matter what I order I am always delighted with my choice!! Servers are also friendly and always efficient, cheerful & polite. Can’t wait to return and wouldn’t hesitate to recommend to anyone looking for somewhere to eat in\nWritten March 8, 2021\nPopo Nguyen\nThank you so much for your wonderful words. Hope we could see you soon\nWritten March 11, 2021\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
